  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pollo guisado is a traditional Latin chicken stew simmered with potatoes, carrots, peppers, and a flavorful tomato-based sauce. Seasoned with garlic, cumin, paprika, and fresh herbs, this comforting dish is tender, hearty, and full of rich flavor. Easy to make in one pot, pollo guisado is perfect for family dinners, meal prep, or gatherings when you want a simple yet delicious recipe. Serve it with rice, beans, or crusty bread for a wholesome, satisfying meal.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-pollo-guisado\">Why You’ll Love This pollo guisado</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-pollo-guisado\">How to Make Pollo Guisado</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-pollo-guisado\">Pro Tips for Making pollo guisado</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-pollo-guisado\">How to Serve this pollo guisado</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-pollo-guisado\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This pollo guisado</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It’s a comforting dish that warms your soul.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Packed with vibrant flavors that dance on your palate.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, perfect for weeknight dinners.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile; customize with your favorite veggies.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for meal prep; tastes even better the next day!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3416\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3416\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow